# cards: Kuntukapu lasts 2 to 4 rounds (docs/plan-cards.md 8, point 4). Lucia wears Kuntukapu (card 230, her slot
# 0x020B46FE) at 1100 points (0x020B48A0) and uses it in round 1 (all allies, no picker): the battle flags
# (0x02282940) gain 0x20; then both Fight each round (the enemies' HP pinned). Expect bit 0x20 cleared at the start
# of round 4, 5, or 6, and the points 1100 -> 1000. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213ba15 1
poke u16 0x020b48a0 1100
poke u16 0x020b46fe 230
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
watch u32 0x02282940 flags
watch u16 0x020b48a0 points
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
shot ku_card
press A 8
wait 60
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
